WEBVTT

00:00:07.866 --> 00:00:09.332
Hi, guys.

00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:12.533
Today, we're talking about sports.

00:00:13.566 --> 00:00:17.432
Let's compare basketball to football.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.400
Did you know, in the U.S.,

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.466
most people think basketball is better than football?

00:00:26.233 --> 00:00:29.599
In fact, they don't even call it 'football'.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.666
They call it 'soccer'!

00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:36.532
Yes, basketball players are taller than football players.

00:00:36.533 --> 00:00:38.966
But in the rest of the world

00:00:38.966 --> 00:00:43.666
football is more popular than basketball.

00:00:43.666 --> 00:00:47.632
In my opinion, football is the winner.

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:51.699
How about yoga and gymnastics?

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.433
Yoga is slower than gymnastics.

00:00:56.433 --> 00:00:59.666
So I think gymnastics is more interesting to watch.

00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:05.166
But, research says doing yoga can make you happy,

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:08.266
so it's healthier for you.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:13.000
And, now, my favourites:

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:17.066
windsurfing and kitesurfing.

00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:21.666
I think windsurfing is more difficult.

00:01:22.466 --> 00:01:25.599
But I think kitesurfing is more exciting.

00:01:29.066 --> 00:01:32.199
Definitely more exciting than yoga!

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.666
Bye!

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.866
Let's talk about the vlog.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:40.933
Which language does the vlogger use to compare two sports?

00:01:43.566 --> 00:01:46.932
We add <i>–er</i> to the end of short adjectives

00:01:46.933 --> 00:01:51.299
to form the comparative: <i>slow/slower.</i>

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:55.333
Yoga is slower than gymnastics.

00:01:57.566 --> 00:02:01.332
We use <i>more</i> before a long adjective to form the comparative:

00:02:01.766 --> 00:02:04.132
<i>popular/more popular.</i>

00:02:05.733 --> 00:02:09.566
Football is more popular than basketball.

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:14.800
Irregular adjectives can use a different word

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:20.000
or different spelling to form the comparative: <i>good/better.</i>

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.400
Basketball is better than football.

00:02:31.433 --> 00:02:32.099
Use it!

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:36.366
Form the comparatives to compare things from each column.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:54.233
<i>Running is <b>faster</b> than rock climbing.</i>

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:55.833
Now you try.

00:03:05.533 --> 00:03:08.366
<i>Table tennis is <b>more boring</b> than volleyball.</i>

00:03:22.566 --> 00:03:26.199
<i>Playing the piano is <b>more difficult</b> than speaking English.</i>

00:03:35.966 --> 00:03:40.132
<i>Hanging out with friends is <b>better</b> than going shopping.</i>